OL,3,GNEWSANHS consultant warns of roadside
OL,4,Abirths risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe risk of babies being born by the
OL,7,Froadside would increase if maternity
OL,8,Funits at two hospitals in Norfolk were
OL,9,Fclosed, a senior obstetrician has
OL,10,Fwarned.
OL,12,FAlastair McKelvey said he was "worried"
OL,13,Fabout the possibility of cuts at the
OL,14,FQueen Elizabeth Hospital in King's Lynn
OL,15,Fand James Paget Hospital in Gorleston.
OL,17,FThe Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,18,FHospitals Group (NWUHG) has set out
OL,19,Fproposals on how services could be
OL,20,Fchanged, but has stressed that no
OL,21,Fdecisions have yet been made.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
